{
    desc => q{Search is case sensitive by default},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_case_sensitive`

**/Hello** is case sensitive and will not match "hello". Only the exact case "Hello" on line 2 is matched.

**Keys:** `/Hello\n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Three lines: "hello", "Hello", "hello"

**after_case_search.png**
- Cursor on "Hello" (capital H) on line 2, col 0
- Only line 2 is highlighted — "hello" (lowercase) on lines 1 and 3 is not matched
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/Hello\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_case_search');
    },
}
__DATA__
hello world
Hello world
hello again
